sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant Git as Git Repository
    participant CICD as CI/CD System<br/>(GitHub Actions /<br/>DevOps Pipelines)
    participant DAB as Declarative<br/>Automation Bundle (DAB)
    participant Registry as Unity Catalog<br/>Model Registry
    participant Serving as Model Serving<br/>Endpoint

    Dev->>Git: Commit code
    Git-->>CICD: Detect change
    CICD->>DAB: Deploy bundle
    DAB->>Registry: Reference model by alias<br/>(e.g. "champion")
    Note over Registry: Model does not move.<br/>Version stays in place.
    DAB->>Serving: Update configuration<br/>to point at right version
    Serving->>Registry: Serve model via alias
